WEBVTT

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:10.800
Magical Stage!

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:19.990
Amazing!!

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:54.250
Doremi!

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:55.630
Doremi-chan!

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:59.650
Congratulations on passing the level 9 exam!

00:02:01.110 --> 00:02:02.640
Thanks!

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:08.130
Thanks for having such a great party for me!

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:10.340
...is what I'd like to say.

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:14.670
But usually at a party there'd be some food.

00:02:14.670 --> 00:02:15.850
Well...

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:18.360
Since you've passed the level 9 exam...

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:22.280
I'd like you to make the food using Magical Stage.

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.290
Magical Stage?

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:26.120
What is that?

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:28.250
You're permitted to use that magic after passing level 9.

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:31.420
It's a magic using all of your magical powers.

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:34.420
That's right! If you combine your hearts together...

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.820
...you can make your magic power grow nearly 2 levels higher.

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:40.890
Ya mean, we can use level 7 magic with it, right?

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:45.250
It's not really that easy, especially for you three.

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:48.780
If it works, we can conjure up an edible steak?

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:50.370
If it works.

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:51.890
It wouldn't disappear right away?

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:53.190
If it works.

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:55.000
Enough for the three of us?

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.260
If it works!

00:02:56.260 --> 00:02:58.670
Perhaps even enough for five people?

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:00.360
If it works!!!

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:03.140
Woohoo!

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:06.340
Now that I've passed the level 9 exam, I can have all the steak I want!

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:09.650
I'm the world's luckiest pretty girl!!

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:10.870
IF IT WORKS!!

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:19.220
Where Did You Go!? Dodo the Fairy.

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:23.510
Doremi!

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:27.680
You have to clear your thoughts, and do what I tell you, got it!?

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.910
Steak, steak!

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:31.340
Don't worry, don't worry!

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:35.320
Let's do it, Hadzuki-chan, Ai-chan!!

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:36.150
Yeah!

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.880
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:44.790
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:50.190
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.630
Magical Stage!

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:05.850
Hurry and say what you want!

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:07.580
Oh, I see.

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.270
Ready, set!

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:12.270
Please give us yummy party food!

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:21.200
Amazing!

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:23.450
You did so well for your first time.

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:26.760
Waah! It's a steak!

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:29.470
It's so tender.

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:32.580
It's so nice to have steak I can actually eat!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.900
But that used up a lot of magic spheres.

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:36.500
Yer right.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:40.960
You cast a higher level of magic, so of course it uses up more spheres.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:44.350
Magical Stage consumes a lot of them,

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:46.650
so don't use it unless it's necessary.

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:48.180
Can I eat now?

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:52.100
There's only one steak. So can I eat it now?

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.900
Brat! Would it hurt to listen to me for once?

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:55.680
Go ahead.

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:56.520
Really?

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.520
Well, today's party is for you after all, Doremi-chan.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:03.450
What great friends I have!

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:06.100
Okay, it's time to eat!

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:13.870
Whyyy!? Why did you eat it!?

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:18.790
I really am the world's unluckiest pretty girl!!

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:22.090
Got it? Except for the people here,

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:24.760
never let anyone else see you.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:29.640
In front of other people, hide yourselves inside these crystal balls.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.050
Do you understand?

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:35.770
So, let's practice disappearing.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:37.720
Rere, hang in there.

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:39.230
Mimi, fight on!

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:43.950
Dodo!

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:45.910
Give me back my steak.

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:49.290
Well then, let's start.

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:49.700
Okay!

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:53.960
Dodo! Your head!

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:00.490
It's not working at all.

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:03.090
Why is it just my fairy?

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:04.680
She's like you!

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:08.430
What's that supposed to mean? I'm not that clumsy.

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:12.950
W-What?

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:13.510
Doremi.

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:16.680
You shouldn't say that.

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:20.900
If Dodo was seen, they'd figure out your identity, wouldn't they?

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:21.860
Ah!

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:26.000
She's your partner, so you must specially train her to disappear.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.700
Okay...

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:30.240
Okay!

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.620
Your head.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.960
Your body.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.630
Your face!!

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:44.610
You really are clumsy.

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:47.650
Hey!

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:52.050
You're not practicing seriously!

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:55.560
Dodo! Why are you pouting?

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:00.530
What kind of attitude is that?

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:01.650
Why you...

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:02.900
Doremi?

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:08.440
P-P-P-P-P-P-P-P-Pop! Could you at least knock before you come in?

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:09.470
I did.

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:11.110
Anyway, what are you hiding?

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:12.990
N-Nothing!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:17.160
Oh? Mom said dinner is ready.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.440
Looks like we're having steak tonight.

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:20.630
Steak?

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:21.330
All right!

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:22.940
Steak, steak...

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:26.000
What's this?

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.120
It's just a glass ball.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.900
Jeez! Give it back!

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:32.020
Pop!

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:36.640
You better not talk to the glass ball in front of people!

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:38.500
Mind your own business.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:42.610
Ah, and for dinner we're having croquettes tonight.

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:44.880
That little...

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:48.350
But... why can't Pop see her?

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:52.600
Hadzuki-chan! Ai-chan!

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:55.120
Doremi-chan, good morning.

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:58.430
Everyone will be able to see Rere and Mimi!

00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:00.400
You shouldn't bring them to school.

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:03.580
Doremi-chan, didn't you listen to Lala?

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:09.010
We're the only ones who can see 'em when they're in their crystal balls.

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:12.520
I see. So that's why Pop couldn't see her...

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:14.830
Doremi-chan, where's Dodo?

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:16.010
I left her at home.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:18.260
Ya never listen to people, do ya?

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:21.440
The fairies've got a lot to learn.

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:23.730
After school, we're supposed to bring 'em over.

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:26.360
Oh... I forgot.

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:36.680
One, two, three, four. One, two, three, four.

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:38.950
One, two, three, four...

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.660
Okay, now.

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:42.450
All right.

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:09.740
Why am I getting heavier?

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:13.990
One, two! One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:17.520
If this doesn't work...

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:24.620
What the heck is this!?

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:28.510
Gotta hurry! Gotta hurry!

00:09:28.510 --> 00:09:29.880
I'm home!

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:31.460
Ah! What happened!?

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:34.760
It looks like the laundry powder fell into the washer...

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:36.630
Could it be...

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:42.710
Hey, hey... is this for real?

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:48.190
What are you doing? Look at what you've done!

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:51.940
How could you do this? I can't believe it...

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.770
Anyway, we have to hurry to the Maho-dou.

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:58.570
Doremi. With a mess like this, where do you think you're going?

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:01.490
This... I didn't do it.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:03.870
If you didn't do it, then who did?

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:05.890
Well... That's...

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:09.360
You are not allowed to leave until you clean your room and do your homework!

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:10.840
Okay...

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:14.550
Here's your snack. Eat and share it with Pop.

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:17.050
Mom has to go on an errand now.

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:18.260
An errand?

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:21.220
Don't even think of sneaking out!

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:22.800
Okay...

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:30.290
I don't understand this...

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.020
I really don't understand this...

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:36.770
Please don't bug me.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:40.470
This and this...

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:43.220
Doremi, where's our snack?

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:44.540
It's on the bed.

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:49.000
You're so mean!

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:51.290
You ate my snack too, didn't you?

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:53.100
I-I didn't.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:57.490
I didn't eat it... but... I guess I did...

00:10:57.490 --> 00:10:59.740
I don't get a thing you're saying!

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:01.960
I'm telling Mom!

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:06.930
Dodo you idiot!

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:10.520
Why do you keep messing around?

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:14.520
If you keep doing this...

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:16.150
I won't care about you anymore!

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:23.140
Dodo!

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:47.990
You IDIOT!!!

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:54.190
Did you scold her just because she was messing around!?

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:55.380
Yeah...

00:11:55.940 --> 00:12:00.170
Dodo is a fairy, but she's still only a baby.

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:01.200
That's right.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:03.910
Fairies can't be like me so fast.

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:05.890
Witches have to raise them.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:08.290
Raise them?

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:10.120
That's right.

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:17.050
As you pass the tests, your fairies will become stronger.

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:20.020
Ya mean... They can talk someday?

00:12:20.020 --> 00:12:21.130
Yes.

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:25.470
Besides, you got Dodo after you passed the makeup test.

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:28.440
Rere and Mimi are older than her.

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:34.600
I guess so. You can't teach a baby by scolding.

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:37.370
If you understand that, then hurry up and search for her.

00:12:37.370 --> 00:12:39.370
We'll help ya.

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:40.320
Let's go.

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:43.030
Thank you, you two.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:59.340
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:14.850
Pretty Witchy Hadzuki-chi!

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.240
Pretty Witchy Aiko-chi!

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:33.160
Would ya take care of Mimi and Rere?

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.910
Leave them to us.

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:36.550
We're leaving then.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.260
I hope they find her...

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:42.400
Yeah... Well, let's go inside now.

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:43.400
Rere, Mimi...

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:46.340
Where'd they go!?

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:47.460
They couldn't have...

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:51.140
Where are you two going!?

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:57.350
We're flying pretty smoothly.

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:58.770
We passed level 9 after all.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:01.130
Let's split up and search.

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:02.110
Good idea.

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:05.840
How 'bout we meet at that chimney in an hour?

00:14:05.840 --> 00:14:06.870
Got it!

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:12.970
Now that I think about it, this is the first time Dodo's been outside.

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:15.530
Just hang on! I'll find you for sure!

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:06.510
Well?

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:08.050
I couldn't find her.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:10.710
It's gonna be harder after dark.

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:11.840
Let's look again.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:12.910
Yeah.

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:17.140
What would you have done if you had gotten lost?

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:18.450
Yeah.

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:23.650
Dodo!

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:27.410
Hey!

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:28.310
Wait up!

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.420
She's not here!

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:47.140
Why did she run away when she saw us?

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:51.340
Huh? Majo Rika...

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:53.920
Why are you here?

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:55.460
Well, lots of reasons.

00:15:55.460 --> 00:15:59.310
We'll have to use the Magical Stage to search for her.

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:00.520
Okay.

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:05.480
Let's do it.

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:08.190
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:13.980
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:19.470
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:23.840
Magical Stage!

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:33.620
Help us find Dodo!

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:44.480
A baked sweet potato?

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.480
Doremi-chan?

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:48.520
W-Why are you looking at me like that?

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:51.000
You must've been thinking you were hungry.

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:52.360
Be serious fer a change!

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:55.320
I-I wasn't thinking about this!

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:57.620
Then what's with the baked potato?

00:16:57.620 --> 00:16:59.080
A baked potato?

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.580
<i>That</i>  baked potato!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.250
That's...

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:03.850
That's...?

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:07.920
Ah! This must be what Dodo likes.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.210
Eeeehhh!?

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:16.890
I can't believe we're trying to find her with that...

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:22.020
I'll take these two back before somebody sees them.

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:23.390
You take take care of the rest.

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:24.390
Okay.

00:17:28.450 --> 00:17:29.730
Doremi-chan?

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:30.730
Hmm?

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:34.380
It's not a detector, so how do we know it's working?

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:35.720
Then do you want me to eat it?

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:40.090
It might help, you know.

00:17:40.090 --> 00:17:40.950
I'll take that!

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:47.270
Kotake!

00:17:47.270 --> 00:17:49.170
Why did you do that?

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.970
Hey, what are you crying about?

00:17:51.970 --> 00:17:53.730
Sorry...

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:55.070
I'll give you this instead.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:57.720
Chocolate?

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:59.930
See ya!

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:01.360
He's gone.

00:18:01.360 --> 00:18:03.340
We're tradin' one thing fer another.

00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:04.990
That's not it.

00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:08.200
Dodo must like this more than baked potatoes!

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:12.910
We have to believe in the Magical Stage.

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:13.960
Hey, hey...

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:20.700
Nonononono!

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:23.520
I don't want candy! I want chocolate!

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:24.250
Chocolate?

00:18:24.250 --> 00:18:27.280
Doremi-chan, ya need to mind yer own business.

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:29.200
This couldn't be an important clue.

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:30.000
You're right.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:33.180
No, we'll have chocolate next time.

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:34.680
CHOCOLATE!!

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:43.950
Um, would you like to trade your candy with my chocolate?

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:46.680
Hey, hey...

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:49.040
We have to believe in the Magical Stage.

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:51.560
Believe! Believe!

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:53.980
Should we really believe it?

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:57.770
We still haven't found her after getting the candy.

00:18:57.770 --> 00:19:00.230
I wonder if the baked potato was right from the start.

00:19:00.230 --> 00:19:03.450
Ya think we should change back to witch apprentices again?

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:04.940
Yeah...

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:06.790
I'm taking this!

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:09.000
In exchange for the cake!

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:11.280
Hey! Pop, wait!!

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:16.960
Wait!

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:18.970
I'm home!

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:20.420
Welcome back!

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:22.100
Wait, Pop!

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:23.580
Excuse us!

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:27.560
It's so lively tonight...

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.650
Give it back to me, Pop!

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:40.380
Too bad for you!

00:19:40.380 --> 00:19:42.820
How could you...

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:46.390
Excuse us again...

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:53.790
We'll have to start all over again.

00:19:57.790 --> 00:20:00.090
The Magical Stage ain't workin'.

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:02.720
I don't think that's the case.

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:05.530
Dodo!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:08.380
Dodo!

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:11.060
Do you know how much we were worried about you?

00:20:12.260 --> 00:20:13.700
I was too!

00:20:17.510 --> 00:20:22.490
I was so worried about you!

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:34.420
I'm sorry, I shouldn't have yelled at you.

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:36.260
I'm really sorry.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:41.320
I'm glad, Doremi-chan.

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:42.170
Yeah.

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:48.160
Oh my, making a mess again?

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:50.090
I don't think so.

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:50.720
Huh?

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:54.550
Looks like Dodo did Doremi's homework.

00:20:56.590 --> 00:20:57.590
Dodo.

00:20:58.290 --> 00:20:59.800
She has her uses.

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:01.150
That's the truth.

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:03.030
Dodo,

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:04.790
thank you.

00:21:07.460 --> 00:21:10.020
Dodo, how about you sleep with me tonight.

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:29.020
Dodo!

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:34.190
You...

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:39.110
Where are you going at a time like this!?

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:40.060
What happened!?

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:44.570
No, ah, uhm, this is... I-I can explain!

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:47.950
A third grader that still wets the bed...

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:49.530
I can't believe you, Doremi...

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:53.190
Not being able to tell sucks!

00:21:53.190 --> 00:21:59.030
Ahhhh! I am the world's unluckiest pretty girl!

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:05.430
Bad news, everyone! Seki-sensei is coming to the Maho-dou!

00:22:05.430 --> 00:22:07.980
If she knows it's being run by kids...

00:22:07.980 --> 00:22:10.160
The Maho-dou can't continue!

00:22:10.160 --> 00:22:11.500
Where are Majo Rika and Lala!?

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:15.070
They won a trip to the hot springs from the Witch World's lottery!

00:22:15.070 --> 00:22:17.130
At a time like this?

00:22:17.130 --> 00:22:20.190
We'll have to make use of our magic!

00:22:21.400 --> 00:22:22.690
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:22.710 --> 00:22:25.380
Pinch! The Teacher Found Out!!

00:22:25.380 --> 00:22:28.390
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
